WEBVTT

00:00:02.037 --> 00:00:05.837
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.241 --> 00:00:10.109
Delivers this message

00:00:10.545 --> 00:00:19.112
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.255 --> 00:00:20.722
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.722 --> 00:00:28.830
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:29.125
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.364 --> 00:00:36.634
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.872 --> 00:00:41.002
But please don't look back

00:00:41.143 --> 00:00:45.170
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:49.476
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.751 --> 00:00:53.187
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.455 --> 00:00:57.357
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.759 --> 00:01:01.422
Delivers this message

00:01:01.863 --> 00:01:10.032
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.405 --> 00:01:18.608
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.047 --> 00:01:28.718
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:32.327 --> 00:01:34.124
While confronting Chusho Sa...

00:01:34.262 --> 00:01:37.060
...Shurei flatly refused her
engagement with Sakujun.

00:01:37.866 --> 00:01:42.166
However her flower bud hair pin
remained in the hands of Sakujun...

00:01:42.804 --> 00:01:45.068
...and Shurei still didn't know
the whereabouts of Eiki Hyo.

00:01:48.009 --> 00:01:52.343
However, she had a pretty clear
idea where Kokujun might be.

00:02:06.928 --> 00:02:08.953
Boss, you're there, aren't you?

00:02:09.631 --> 00:02:10.461
How did you guess?

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:13.693
I kinda sensed it.
So, how was it?

00:02:14.202 --> 00:02:18.229
As you suspected there's a strange
shrine at the edge of the courtyard.

00:02:19.775 --> 00:02:20.434
Just as I thought.

00:02:20.976 --> 00:02:22.238
What is it?

00:02:22.944 --> 00:02:23.911
In residences owned by the rich...

00:02:23.979 --> 00:02:25.173
...there's usually a shrine
for worshipping...

00:02:25.247 --> 00:02:27.147
...the Eight Colored
Enlightened Ones.

00:02:27.616 --> 00:02:31.746
Since it's so natural to have such a
shrine, I had forgotten they exist.

00:02:32.587 --> 00:02:34.782
I see. I understand now.

00:02:35.323 --> 00:02:37.518
I'm sure that's where the
entrance to the basement is.

00:02:37.959 --> 00:02:40.484
But the thing is, there are guards
in front of it. What'll we do?

00:02:41.463 --> 00:02:43.727
Tonight they're having the selection
ceremony for the head of the Sa Clan.

00:02:43.799 --> 00:02:46.267
The guards are bound to be too busy
guarding the gate and main building.

00:02:46.435 --> 00:02:48.699
If there's ever gonna be a time with
less guards there, today's that day.

00:02:49.204 --> 00:02:53.732
Huh? Ah... Well... I'm really sorry,
but tonight isn't good for me.

00:02:53.975 --> 00:02:54.964
What?!

00:02:55.043 --> 00:02:58.911
I've already accepted an assignment
for tonight. So, if you'll excuse me.

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:01.676
W-Wait, Shorin! Great...!

00:03:03.151 --> 00:03:05.745
In that case, I'll just
have to go over there alone.

00:03:06.555 --> 00:03:11.515
No Use Crying Over Spilt Milk

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.608
You need to be at the
selection ceremony shortly.

00:03:27.809 --> 00:03:30.277
So why are you here drinking,
not even getting ready?

00:03:31.813 --> 00:03:33.678
Because I don't feel like going.

00:03:33.748 --> 00:03:36.740
You really have no motivation
to do anything, do you?!

00:03:37.652 --> 00:03:39.620
To me, I find more
importance in this...

00:03:39.688 --> 00:03:42.851
...being the last day that
I'll spend with you.

00:03:43.959 --> 00:03:45.927
Come on!

00:03:46.795 --> 00:03:49.127
Hey, won't you do up
my hair for me?

00:03:49.764 --> 00:03:53.757
I'm not your maid. Why not ask
someone else to do that sort of thing?

00:03:54.903 --> 00:03:56.871
I don't want anyone else doing it.

00:04:01.042 --> 00:04:03.476
Could you do up my hair
and make some tea for me?

00:04:05.547 --> 00:04:07.606
All right. Since it will
be the last time.

00:04:16.625 --> 00:04:19.389
You seem kinda quiet.
Have you had too much to drink?

00:04:19.995 --> 00:04:21.963
Are you not feeling well?

00:04:22.931 --> 00:04:25.900
No. I have a strong
stomach for alcohol.

00:04:26.535 --> 00:04:29.800
Come to think of it I've
never seen you drunk.

00:04:30.438 --> 00:04:32.406
Right?

00:04:35.377 --> 00:04:38.278
Okay, I'm done.

00:04:38.747 --> 00:04:40.874
If you're not going to the ceremony
then you could use some more sleep.

00:04:40.949 --> 00:04:42.940
I'll pour some hot water for you.

00:04:44.619 --> 00:04:46.553
I'd prefer Gan Lu tea.

00:04:47.122 --> 00:04:48.146
No.

00:04:48.223 --> 00:04:49.315
Why not?

00:04:49.391 --> 00:04:51.359
Because.

00:04:53.461 --> 00:04:55.929
The shelves look kinda
different than usual.

00:04:56.164 --> 00:04:58.132
There seems to be
more empty space.

00:05:00.936 --> 00:05:03.404
Gan Lu tea's the only kind
of tea leaf you have?!

00:05:03.738 --> 00:05:07.401
You did reject your engagement
with me so bluntly...

00:05:07.909 --> 00:05:11.436
...I don't think it would be
asking too much to have you...

00:05:12.047 --> 00:05:14.277
...let me savor a little sweet
thought before you leave.

00:05:14.349 --> 00:05:17.580
This man wants to drink
Gan Lu tea that badly?!

00:05:19.454 --> 00:05:21.422
Here. Have some hot water.

00:05:27.362 --> 00:05:29.091
Are you worried about me?

00:05:29.164 --> 00:05:29.994
I guess I am.

00:05:30.065 --> 00:05:33.501
You seem even more strange
than usual, so I'm a little worried.

00:05:35.103 --> 00:05:38.504
You're very kind. Then I'll drink it.

00:05:46.881 --> 00:05:48.815
There. I drank some.

00:05:48.883 --> 00:05:51.351
So this time, I'd like you to
make some Gan Lu tea for me.

00:05:51.953 --> 00:05:52.851
No way.

00:05:54.322 --> 00:05:57.314
You've been drinking wine.
And a lot of it.

00:05:57.759 --> 00:05:59.727
If wine gets mixed with Gan Lu
tea in a weird way...

00:05:59.794 --> 00:06:01.694
...you could make yourself sick.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:04.921
Just have the hot water today
and have yourself a good sleep.

00:06:05.734 --> 00:06:07.725
I don't care if I end up getting sick.

00:06:08.937 --> 00:06:12.395
Because today's the last day
I can have you make me tea.

00:06:13.708 --> 00:06:15.573
Now, come on.

00:06:15.644 --> 00:06:19.273
If you don't brew
Gan Lu tea for me, I'll die!

00:06:20.982 --> 00:06:22.950
That's something a
child would say.

00:06:25.654 --> 00:06:27.622
Really, I guess I'll have to.

00:06:31.326 --> 00:06:33.794
Say, do you remember
that promise you made?

00:06:33.928 --> 00:06:36.590
Of course. I'll return
your flower bud to you.

00:06:37.499 --> 00:06:39.467
You seem awfully busy...

00:06:39.934 --> 00:06:42.402
...so come back here once you feel
you're finished with everything else.

00:06:42.671 --> 00:06:45.299
You know, I wouldn't mind
having it returned now.

00:06:46.608 --> 00:06:49.076
Actually, I insist you give
it back to me right now.

00:06:49.577 --> 00:06:51.545
There's no fantasy in that.

00:06:53.214 --> 00:06:56.240
Fantasy? For me?

00:07:01.056 --> 00:07:02.318
What's the matter?

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:04.017
No. It's nothing.

00:07:04.659 --> 00:07:05.523
Is that so?

00:07:25.046 --> 00:07:27.241
I wonder if it's really all right.

00:07:27.549 --> 00:07:30.950
Why? It's an official invitation
that the Sa Clan gave us.

00:07:31.786 --> 00:07:34.254
We'll hold our heads high and
enter through the front gate.

00:07:34.622 --> 00:07:35.782
Right.

00:07:36.858 --> 00:07:39.190
Anything could happen during
the selection ceremony.

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:40.352
You take care of that end.

00:07:40.428 --> 00:07:43.329
Right. And you make
sure Shunki's safe.

00:07:43.998 --> 00:07:46.466
The people from the Sa Clan
know what she looks like.

00:07:46.568 --> 00:07:49.036
- Be careful.
- I know!

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:55.801
Fortunately, it's a new moon tonight.
Perfect for sneaking in.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.843
Well then, shall we go now?

00:08:00.915 --> 00:08:01.506
Sure.

00:08:31.713 --> 00:08:33.681
Kansho?

00:08:42.257 --> 00:08:44.225
Bakuya?

00:08:59.741 --> 00:09:04.201
Ryuki. You're a man, so that should
keep your Bakuya a little quieter.

00:09:06.948 --> 00:09:10.384
That Bakuya and this
Kansho are yin and yang...

00:09:10.819 --> 00:09:13.287
...the same sword made in
two parts by the Hyo Clan.

00:09:14.189 --> 00:09:17.158
It's said that if they're forcibly separated
from each other, they put up resistance.

00:09:17.525 --> 00:09:20.050
But apparently Bakuya, which
possesses a woman's nature...

00:09:20.461 --> 00:09:24.192
...will remain quiet if
wielded by a man.

00:09:27.602 --> 00:09:29.627
It may still be difficult for you.

00:09:31.339 --> 00:09:34.103
If Bakuya is female,
then Kansho is male.

00:09:35.143 --> 00:09:36.610
It's a reflection of your
great skill, Seien...

00:09:36.678 --> 00:09:38.475
...that you can keep
Kansho under control.

00:09:40.215 --> 00:09:42.945
- The origin of the twin swords is...
- Exorcism.

00:09:44.252 --> 00:09:47.278
For these swords, forged to
obliterate demons, to start howling...

00:09:48.189 --> 00:09:49.156
Shunki. From this point on...

00:09:49.224 --> 00:09:52.489
...we'll be heading in a different
direction than you.

00:09:53.895 --> 00:09:55.863
This sword is gentle
towards women.

00:09:56.798 --> 00:09:59.892
It will definitely protect you.
Please take it.

00:10:04.105 --> 00:10:06.073
Even if I don't have
this sword with me...!

00:10:06.341 --> 00:10:09.071
You over there! Identify
yourself! Hey, come out!

00:10:09.911 --> 00:10:11.401
- What's going on?
- Over here!

00:10:11.479 --> 00:10:13.447
Is that them?!

00:10:14.315 --> 00:10:16.283
Shunki?

00:10:20.655 --> 00:10:22.623
What are you doing?

00:10:30.298 --> 00:10:33.790
- Wh-Who is she?
- Wait... this person is...!

00:11:14.275 --> 00:11:16.243
Why, of course.

00:11:16.744 --> 00:11:20.441
I forgot that she was a blood relative
of the clan that created you.

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:24.118
Whether you look at her or My Lady...

00:11:24.485 --> 00:11:27.579
...I'm embarrassed to say the
women are stronger by far.

00:11:30.391 --> 00:11:32.359
Now...

00:11:34.395 --> 00:11:36.363
I will do what I must.

00:11:40.668 --> 00:11:42.602
Listen, Shunki.

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:47.164
Promise me that you'll only use that
power for the sake of one person.

00:11:48.476 --> 00:11:53.379
That one special person
whom you'll meet one day.

00:11:58.052 --> 00:12:01.954
With all your effort go and
save the fool that you love.

00:12:04.192 --> 00:12:06.752
Just like I did once in the past.

00:12:17.772 --> 00:12:19.740
There it is.

00:12:24.379 --> 00:12:26.279
Guards?

00:12:31.452 --> 00:12:33.420
In that case...!

00:12:34.055 --> 00:12:39.015
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:12:50.838 --> 00:12:53.830
I have evidence!
Get out of my way immediately!

00:12:54.208 --> 00:12:55.175
We cannot do that.

00:12:55.243 --> 00:12:58.804
We have been ordered by
Chusho not to let anyone through.

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:01.148
Is there someone in there?

00:13:01.249 --> 00:13:03.342
There's no one!
There's nobody in there!

00:13:04.018 --> 00:13:06.612
If there's nobody in there, then
what's the problem? Let me through!

00:13:07.088 --> 00:13:08.953
N-No! You'll suffer
divine punishment!

00:13:09.424 --> 00:13:10.391
Are you nuts?

00:13:10.458 --> 00:13:13.791
Divine punishment comes from
the gods, not the enlightened ones!

00:13:13.961 --> 00:13:15.121
What are you saying?!

00:13:15.229 --> 00:13:17.060
She's being a pain. Capture her!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.095
- What?!
- What is it?

00:13:21.169 --> 00:13:22.431
Shurei Hong.

00:13:22.503 --> 00:13:26.439
Please keep your ears covered with
your hands until I say it's all right.

00:13:29.243 --> 00:13:31.211
Wh-Why are they moving
on their own?

00:13:34.348 --> 00:13:35.838
All you rank-and-file guards...

00:13:35.917 --> 00:13:38.977
...remain unconscious
until I command otherwise!

00:13:44.592 --> 00:13:46.560
What?! What on earth
just happened here?!

00:13:47.161 --> 00:13:49.129
It's all right now.

00:13:51.833 --> 00:13:53.858
It's a great pleasure to finally
meet you, Shurei Hong.

00:13:53.935 --> 00:13:56.961
My name is Shunki Sa.

00:13:58.172 --> 00:14:01.938
Shunki... But I thought
you couldn't speak.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:06.307
No, it's not that I can't speak.
I simply chose not to speak.

00:14:08.816 --> 00:14:10.784
The words that come
out of my mouth...

00:14:11.452 --> 00:14:14.546
...contain in them the power to
force people to do as I say.

00:14:15.323 --> 00:14:17.291
This power is
extremely dangerous.

00:14:18.359 --> 00:14:21.954
That's why, in order to hide this power
from people, I kept my voice sealed.

00:14:23.331 --> 00:14:25.799
Who would've figured
something like that...!

00:14:32.673 --> 00:14:36.370
I-I have no idea what it is,
but I'm positive it can't be good.

00:14:37.378 --> 00:14:39.346
Come with me.

00:14:51.826 --> 00:14:53.225
That man...!

00:14:53.327 --> 00:14:54.794
Great Uncle Chusho?

00:14:57.765 --> 00:14:59.995
I can't believe someone
like him could...

00:15:03.938 --> 00:15:05.906
I'm not gonna die.

00:15:06.073 --> 00:15:10.601
I've come this far and everything
is about to become mine.

00:15:18.019 --> 00:15:21.511
Chusho. I've come to deliver
the thing that I promised you.

00:15:23.758 --> 00:15:26.488
Here is the ring that marks the
bearer as head of the Sa Clan.

00:15:38.372 --> 00:15:40.306
What's the meaning of this?

00:15:40.374 --> 00:15:44.811
It is the pride of a merchant to
meet any request from his customer.

00:15:45.546 --> 00:15:46.808
However...

00:15:47.381 --> 00:15:49.315
I cannot give it to you.

00:15:49.383 --> 00:15:51.851
As a member of a family that
has confronted many generations...

00:15:51.919 --> 00:15:54.979
...of Sa Clan tyranny, a proud clan
of government officials...

00:15:55.056 --> 00:15:57.616
...who are determined to
uphold discipline...

00:15:58.092 --> 00:16:00.890
...without yielding to others,
this is my answer.

00:16:05.333 --> 00:16:07.801
All mayors of Sa Province
have already entered Koren...

00:16:08.536 --> 00:16:11.994
...bringing with them the evidence
to condemn the Sa Clan.

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.171
What?

00:16:14.242 --> 00:16:18.338
In particular, Ensei Ro and
Yushun Tei have made their move.

00:16:19.046 --> 00:16:20.513
They have also stopped the
anticipated riots in Koren...

00:16:20.581 --> 00:16:24.073
...that you instigated, before the
riots even got started.

00:16:24.719 --> 00:16:28.052
Soon the official military
officers of Sa Province...

00:16:28.556 --> 00:16:30.683
...as well as our Merchants
Guild elite soldiers...

00:16:30.758 --> 00:16:33.226
...will descend onto the gathered
Sa Clan to bind them in ropes.

00:16:39.867 --> 00:16:42.597
So they'll be binding the clan
members in ropes, you say?

00:16:44.338 --> 00:16:47.466
Go ahead and try binding corpses
with ropes and drag them away!

00:16:47.975 --> 00:16:49.840
What did you say?!

00:16:55.016 --> 00:16:57.712
It's almost time for the
selection ceremony.

00:16:58.819 --> 00:17:00.047
I was also finding those people...

00:17:00.121 --> 00:17:02.055
overly concerned about
purity of the bloodline...

00:17:02.123 --> 00:17:04.591
...or tainting from blood outside
the clan, to be a nuisance.

00:17:05.059 --> 00:17:08.893
I was planning to use the ceremony
as an opportunity to clean house!

00:17:10.765 --> 00:17:14.132
Just like my elder brother,
Enjun Sa did!

00:17:15.603 --> 00:17:16.501
You're not saying...!

00:17:26.981 --> 00:17:30.314
Let's go! We must notify Governor
To and Lieutenant Governor Ro!

00:17:30.418 --> 00:17:31.350
Wait!

00:17:47.201 --> 00:17:48.429
Chusho Sa.

00:17:48.502 --> 00:17:49.764
Once details of your
crimes are made clear...

00:17:49.837 --> 00:17:51.896
...I'll decide what will
become of you.

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:56.607
If you have any pride as a member
of the Sa Clan wait right here.

00:17:57.311 --> 00:18:00.371
Finish what you must do first
before I place you under arrest.

00:18:02.616 --> 00:18:04.982
I'll call for a doctor.
You mustn't move.

00:18:07.922 --> 00:18:10.482
Let's arrange for a doctor.
But, it may already be...!

00:18:11.425 --> 00:18:13.552
That may be true. But still...!

00:18:15.463 --> 00:18:16.828
Thank you very much.

00:18:18.933 --> 00:18:20.798
You've shown real concern for
Great-Uncle Chusho...

00:18:20.868 --> 00:18:22.529
...to the last moment.

00:18:23.337 --> 00:18:25.999
I thank you, Governor Hong,
for your kindness.

00:18:27.341 --> 00:18:29.309
Shunki.

00:18:31.812 --> 00:18:33.643
Governor Hong.

00:18:34.281 --> 00:18:38.012
You've done magnificently
at your job as a governor.

00:18:43.991 --> 00:18:46.653
Mr. Sho Sai, will you please
attend the selection ceremony?

00:18:47.561 --> 00:18:49.529
I'll be going with Shunki.

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:52.224
Very well. Here, please take this.

00:18:55.136 --> 00:18:57.229
Governor To had me hold
on to it for you.

00:18:58.005 --> 00:19:00.473
When the Governor's Seal
is returned to you...

00:19:00.574 --> 00:19:03.839
...you'll be the governor of Sa Province
once again in both name and deed.

00:19:05.146 --> 00:19:07.410
Thank you very much for
delivering the seal to me.

00:19:09.717 --> 00:19:13.209
You know, I apologize for ever
having suspected you. I'm sorry.

00:19:13.954 --> 00:19:15.182
You did the right thing.

00:19:15.256 --> 00:19:17.690
You wouldn't be doing your
job properly if you believed...

00:19:17.825 --> 00:19:19.656
...anyone and everyone that easily.

00:19:19.727 --> 00:19:22.161
You must be especially
cautious of men like me.

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:24.498
Then, good luck to you.

00:19:25.466 --> 00:19:27.400
We'll be sure to catch
up to you later.

00:19:28.469 --> 00:19:30.903
Well, we should get
going too. Are you ready?

00:19:32.273 --> 00:19:34.741
I came here with that intention,
from the beginning.

00:19:42.249 --> 00:19:44.217
What's wrong?

00:19:46.821 --> 00:19:48.550
I wonder what that is.

00:19:57.565 --> 00:19:59.556
Elder Brother Enjun.

00:20:00.935 --> 00:20:04.996
If only I had a little more
luck and talent.

00:20:07.141 --> 00:20:09.109
You fool.

00:20:11.145 --> 00:20:15.514
Did you think Enjun climbed that
high with luck and talent alone?

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:21.752
Who are you? How do you
know about me and Enjun?

00:20:24.425 --> 00:20:27.656
Well, at this point,
I don't care who you are.

00:20:29.096 --> 00:20:31.064
If Enjun had luck and talent...

00:20:31.131 --> 00:20:34.259
...he wouldn't have had to
struggle so much.

00:20:35.369 --> 00:20:40.033
Even over thorns, on top of
red-hot iron or on frozen snow...

00:20:41.809 --> 00:20:44.972
...he was the type of man who would
willingly walk barefooted despite it.

00:20:46.647 --> 00:20:49.275
I don't know any other
man as foolish.

00:20:50.885 --> 00:20:53.911
If there was anything that
he possessed a lot of...

00:20:54.722 --> 00:20:57.657
...it would be the kindness of his heart
and his unwavering perseverance.

00:20:58.459 --> 00:21:01.860
Even if covered in wounds he would
never utter a single complaint.

00:21:02.897 --> 00:21:04.888
He would not even
glance at his wounds...

00:21:04.965 --> 00:21:07.365
...and would proceed down the
path that he believed in.

00:21:10.104 --> 00:21:12.072
Elder Brother...!

00:21:12.573 --> 00:21:15.872
Enjun no longer has time
left to share with you.

00:21:17.077 --> 00:21:21.241
That's why I've come, on his request
that I see your final moments.

00:21:25.452 --> 00:21:28.387
Back then, you saw
everything, didn't you?

00:21:29.456 --> 00:21:33.119
Are you really unable to
remember what Eiki said then?

00:21:42.303 --> 00:21:45.830
It's not your fault!
None of this is your fault!

00:21:46.473 --> 00:21:47.667
Why is it necessary
for you to carry...

00:21:47.741 --> 00:21:49.470
...everything upon your
shoulders alone?!

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:51.978
Enjun!

00:21:57.952 --> 00:22:00.443
You were wrong from
the very beginning.

00:22:01.922 --> 00:22:03.913
There's no way that you...

00:22:03.991 --> 00:22:05.686
...who never tried to
understand anything...

00:22:05.759 --> 00:22:07.283
...could've ever surpassed Enjun.

00:22:07.561 --> 00:22:10.655
Even though that idiot
tried to protect everything.

00:22:13.667 --> 00:22:16.534
I... I...!

00:22:31.085 --> 00:22:35.454
En... jun... elder bro... ther...!

00:22:53.641 --> 00:22:56.371
There's no use crying
over spilt milk, is there?

00:22:57.177 --> 00:22:59.111
It's all too late now.

00:22:59.179 --> 00:23:01.204
All because you continued
doing the unnecessary...

00:23:01.281 --> 00:23:02.839
...right to the end, Enjun...!

00:23:08.722 --> 00:23:10.986
The start of the selection ceremony
for the head of the Sa Clan...

00:23:11.058 --> 00:23:11.990
...was approaching.

00:23:13.961 --> 00:23:17.624
As everyone was running
towards their goals...

00:23:19.199 --> 00:23:21.929
...Shurei and Shunki were
following a dark path...

00:23:22.903 --> 00:23:25.303
...in search of Kokujun Sa.

00:23:30.544 --> 00:23:35.641
You've always led a very carefree
life and right now

00:23:35.783 --> 00:23:42.347
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.456 --> 00:23:47.519
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.628 --> 00:23:52.622
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.701 --> 00:23:58.161
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.707 --> 00:24:04.838
You are just like me

00:24:05.579 --> 00:24:10.107
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.184 --> 00:24:16.089
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.057 --> 00:24:22.859
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:22.963 --> 00:24:27.832
I will always think of you

00:24:28.969 --> 00:24:41.643
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

